<section class="wrap">
  <div class="grid two">
    <div class="frame reveal">
      <h3>What is held, exactly</h3>
      <ul class="biblio">
        <li>Your email address, and the name you chose to be called by.</li>
        <li>A session token per device, good for thirty days, revocable here.</li>
        <li>A public key for each passkey — never a fingerprint, never a face.</li>
        <li>If you passed the document check: your declared legal name, date of birth and the photograph
        you supplied, stored privately and never published.</li>
        <li>If you passed by face scan: the estimated number, and one frame only where the reading was
        taken in your browser and nothing else witnessed it.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="frame reveal">
      <h3>Leaving</h3>
      <p>Signing out ends this device's session at once. If you want the account and everything attached
      to it erased — address, documents, letters, the lot — write to
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> from the address on file and it will be done,
      without an argument and without a retention offer.</p>
      <p class="muted small">We would rather have ten people who want to be here than a thousand who
      cannot find the door out.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
